{"3834950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skyborn:IronWings", "steam_appid": 3834950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyborn: IronWings reinvents the spirit of classic arcade shooters—now expanded into a <strong>multi-form combat experience</strong> across air and ground. Each mission delivers a <strong>distinct style of warfare</strong>, challenging players to master different combat roles as the campaign unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some missions place you in the cockpit, engaging in high-speed <strong>3D aerial combat</strong> filled with intense bullet-hell action. Dodge incoming fire, outmaneuver enemy squadrons, and unleash upgradeable weapons including homing missiles, lasers, and powerful bomb attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other missions shift the focus to the battlefield below. Fight on the ground as a <strong>soldier in fast-paced top-down combat</strong>, or take control of <strong>armored vehicles</strong> to push through enemy forces with raw firepower and tactical positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is built around <strong>one dedicated combat style</strong>—air, infantry, or armored assault—ensuring tight pacing, focused mechanics, and constant variety throughout the game. No mid-mission switching, just pure arcade intensity tailored to the role you play in that battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master every form of combat and dominate a war fought across sky and ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834950/extras/936b1e436e6a6b9134859fd16cd17e2c.poster.avif?t=1780754679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834950/extras/936b1e436e6a6b9134859fd16cd17e2c.webm?t=1780754679\" type